# Use examples: each recipe run once
# bareproxy 0.16.0, built with go1.27.3, 2026-10-31 10:44:03 UTC, Linux x86_64

## Recipes 1 to 3 share this config

global
  admin /work/admin.sock
  state /work/state
  trace-log /work/requests.log 10MB 2

site http://hooks.test:56529
  route /hooks/stripe -> inbox stripe
  route /hooks/github -> inbox github

inbox stripe
  deliver app
  signature stripe /work/etc/stripe-secret
  retry 5s 2m

inbox github
  deliver app
  signature github /work/etc/github-secret
  key-header X-GitHub-Delivery
  retry 2s 5s
  give-up 15s

pool app
  backend 127.0.0.1:39059
  health /healthz
$ bareproxy check /work/hooks.conf
/work/hooks.conf: ok, 1 site, 1 pool, 2 rules; listening on :56529 (http)

