## Recipe 5: drift every hour inside the server, with a webhook alert

global
  admin /work/admin2.sock
  state /work/state2

site http://status.test:47465
  route /* -> respond 200 "ok"

drift sites
  domains www.example.test shop.example.test
  resolver 127.0.0.1:54879
  port 59937
  ca /work/net/t-ca.pem
  every 1h
  webhook http://127.0.0.1:38069/bareproxy

The alert receiver got:
{"watch":"sites","domains":2,"alerts":[{"domain":"shop.example.test","text":"certificate ends in 11 days (2026-11-12 10:45 UTC), inside the 21-day window"}],"unchecked":0}

$ bareproxy events -c /work/server-drift.conf
